  "title": "PDD Holdings to Report Second Quarter 2025 Unaudited Financial Results on August 25, 2025",
  "summary": "DUBLIN and SHANGHAI, Aug. 18, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- PDD Holdings Inc. (“PDD Holdings” or the “Company”) (NASDAQ: PDD) today announced that it will report its unaudited financial results for the second quarter ended June 30, 2025, before U.S. markets open on Monday, August 25, 2025.",
